    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "心智模型",
      "items": [
        "每个节点是一个 map[rune]*TrieNode：字符进 map，isEnd 标记单词结尾",
        "公共前缀只存一份：app 被 apple / apply / application 共享",
        "root 不存字符，实际字符从 root.children 开始"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Search 与 StartsWith 的差别",
      "items": [
        "Search(\"app\")=true：路径存在且终点 isEnd=true",
        "Search(\"appl\")=false：路径存在但 isEnd=false，不是完整单词",
        "StartsWith(\"ap\")=true：只要 findNode 路径存在即可，不查 isEnd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "查询/补全怎么走",
      "items": [
        "findNode 沿 children 逐字符下探：Search / StartsWith 均为 O(L)",
        "Autocomplete(\"app\",5)=[app, apple, application, apply]（真实输出）",
        "图里省略了 apt 与 application 的中段字符，实际树上它们各占节点"
      ]
    }
  ]
